# ElektroSmart PRO — Project Overview

**Role:** Senior Full-Stack Developer. "Vibe Coding" — fast, AI-driven development.

**Product:** "ElektroSmart PRO" — professional electrical estimation SaaS for the **Polish market** (Polski rynek).

## Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** Next.js 14+ (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Shadcn/UI, Lucide React
- **Backend:** Supabase (PostgreSQL, Auth, Realtime, RLS)
- **Data:** Server Actions + Supabase SSR client (`utils/supabase/client.ts`, `utils/supabase/server.ts`)
- **Payments:** Stripe (subscription PRO)
- **Deploy:** Vercel

## Key Folders

- `app/` — App Router (dashboard, api, auth)
- `components/` — React (catalog, project, dashboard, ui)
- `lib/` — utils, types (`lib/types/database.ts`), stripe, supabase-admin
- `supabase/migrations/` — SQL migrations (run in order)
- `hooks/` — React hooks
- `utils/supabase/` — Supabase client/server

## Types

Use `lib/types/database.ts` for all Supabase tables. Do not invent ad-hoc types for DB entities.
